sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Staff action
  participant W as Compass worker
  participant DB as D1 queue tables
  participant AG as On-prem agent<br/>(poller or writer)
  participant ACC as Accounting system
  U->>W: e.g. create project, queue pay-app sync
  W->>DB: insert operation (status queued)
  loop every minute
    AG->>W: GET /api/integrations/sage/.../requests<br/>signed: timestamp, request id, HMAC
    W->>DB: verify, store nonce, heartbeat sage_bridge_status
    W->>DB: claim rows (claim_token, claimed_at), re-claim stale
    W-->>AG: claimed work (JSON, zod-validated)
    AG->>ACC: read (SQL, read-only login) or write (vendor API)
    AG->>W: POST .../results with id + claim_token
    W->>DB: complete / needs_review / failed (409 if claim stale)
  end
  Note over W: Every 10 min: health check raises an<br/>offline notification if a heartbeat is older than 5 min
